(350, 'Level-2', '04512430088', 'www.avfchospital.com', '25/08/2013', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', '', '', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Yes', 'Laser Assisted Hatching', 'Percutaneous Epididymal Sperm Aspiration(PESA), Testicular Sperm Aspiration(TESA), Testicular Sperm Extraction(TESE),\r\nBlastocyst Separation Techinique, Endometrial Receptivity Array.\r\nMALE FACTOR: a.Treatment of oligozoospermia, b.Detecting infection of the reproductive tract using appropriate diagnostic test, \r\nc.Immunological test for infertility, d.Provision for semen collection in men with a vibrator or an Electroejaculator in erectile dysfunction and ejaculatory problems,\r\n e.Karyotyping.\r\nFEMALE FACTOR: a.Treatment of minor anatomical defects like imperforate hymen, b.Treatment of endometriosis after confirming its presence by diagnostic laparoscopy, \r\nc.Induction of ovulation in anovulatory women with drugs such as Clomiphene citrate etc., d.Correcting endocrine disorders such as Thyroid disorders, Hyperprolactinemia,\r\n e.Detecting infection of the reproductive tract using appropriate diagnostictest. \r\nConservative surgery : Laparoscopy, Hysteroscopy\r\nCombined medical - surgical theraphy a co-ordinated team, for example in endometriosis, Assessment of follicular growth and ovulation by serial ultrasonography,\r\nImmunological test for infertility, Assessment of follicular growth and ovulation by serial transvaginal sonography(TVS),\r\nProvision for extended treatment of infertiity except for oocyte pick up, Karyotyping,Saline sono salphingography, Hysterosalpingogram(HSG)\r\nANDROLOGY:Basic investigation such as physical examination and semen analysis as per WHO method, Advanced Sperm Function test like hypo-osmotic swelling test(HOST),\r\nTest for sperm function and integrity such as acrosome reaction and sperm-oocyte interaction in-vitro.		', 1, 721, 'Pending', NULL, NULL, NULL, '2022-04-27 10:05:52'),
