(42, 'pramilahospitalandivf@gmail.com', 'update name, address and nature of the organization.', '2022-07-14', 1, '2022-07-15 06:30:34'),
(43, 'shivamivfhospital@gmail.com', 'Respected sir/mam \r\nKindly please change our hospital name and email id because old name is entered too long and mail id is write  to doctor mail id\r\n so kindly please changes is possible', '2022-07-15', 1, '2022-07-18 06:27:43'),
(44, 'careandcurebharuch@gmail.com', 'Dear Sir/Mam,\r\nWe have sign up into the National Art & Surrogacy Portal with name of the CARE AND CURE HOSPITAL (A UNIT OF TAPURIAH  ASSOCIATES). Screenshot attached here for your reference.\r\n\r\nKindly change it from  CARE AND CURE HOSPITAL (A UNIT OF TAPURIAH ASSOCIATES) to CARE AND CURE HOSPITAL.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards,\r\nRoshani Rana\r\nCare and Cure Hospital\r\nBharuch\r\n+91 8866089757', '2022-07-18', 1, '2022-07-22 03:17:47'),
(45, 'jeevanmithraivf@gmail.com', 'Sir,\r\nMy website address had been wrongly entered in application form. kindly change in my application form.\r\nwrong address sent-jeevanmithraivfcentre.com\r\ncorrect address- jeevanmithrafertilitycentre.com.\r\nAlready i had applied for correction twice by mail. please respond.\r\nthanking you', '2022-07-18', 1, '2022-07-22 03:19:37'),
(46, 'drroshiaiims@gmail.com', 'Respected Sir/Madam,\r\nI am Dr. Roshi Satija.I was filling the ART registration form and have saved it in the draft.The name of the centre in the PNDT registration office is GOD\'s GRACE IVF &Fertility Centre, but by mistake i have filled it as GODs GRACE fertility and IVF.I called up the support team today at the ART registration office and they guided me to email my problem at this email id.Kindly help me and guide me to put the correct name in the ART registration form with the help of your IT team at the earliest.Thank you.\r\nRegards\r\nDr Roshi Satija\r\n9958722133 ', '2022-07-21', 1, '2022-07-22 08:42:43'),
(47, 'jaharivf@gmail.com', 'Dear Sir,\r\nNeed help i have done payment but my institute name was having spelling error while form fill up .\r\nKindly help if i can use that payment thing.', '2022-07-27', 0, '2022-07-28 05:51:35'),
(48, 'bsagarwaldr@gmail.com', 'Dear Sir\r\nWe wanted a clarification on one issue.\r\nThe address with which we have applied will  change due to some unavoidable circumstances.\r\nPlease let us know the provisions for the above and in case the name also changes.\r\nRegards\r\nDr Binod S Agarwal\r\nClinical Director\r\nJamshedpur Fertility and Endoscopy center & SPARSH IVF ', '2022-08-02', 0, '2022-08-05 10:03:14'),
(49, 'ashwinchitrathangavel@gmail.com', 'Respected Sir/Madam,\r\nWe have applied for ART Level II clinic. My application number is TN/AC/2022/11710. Our ART clinic name is ASHWIN MODULAR TEST TUBE BABY CENTRE.We applied it correctly But in the application sent by you by the port is showing my hospital name ( ASHWIN HOSPITAL) Kindly correct the ART clinic name as  ASHWIN MODULAR TEST TUBE BABY CENTRE or kindly guide me the way to correct it. \r\n\r\n\r\nThanking you\r\nDR.P.CHITRA.\r\nASHWIN MODULAR TEST TUBE BABY CENTRE', '2022-09-09', 1, '2022-08-11 05:59:06'),
(50, 'ashwinchitrathangavel@gmail.com', 'Respected Sir,\r\nwe  have applied for ART clinic Registration our application number is TN/AC/2022/11710. In the place of ART clinic name : \"ASHWIN MODULAR TEST TUBE BABY CENTRE\" must come, instead of ASHWIN HOSPITAL. Kindly help us to change the name.', '2022-08-22', 1, '2022-08-26 10:38:16'),
(51, 'cao.ppmaniya001@gmail.com', 'Subject: Re: regarding ID and Password for portal national ART and surrogancy registry.\r\ndear sir, \r\nthis time we get success but we did not complete the details before registration. So how can we update the name and address of an organization. so kindly guide us.... or whether a new id will be required to create. \r\nso kindly guide us.\r\ndr. bhupendra makwana\r\nph.no. 9328192545', '2022-09-22', 1, '2022-09-22 11:04:33'),
(52, 'bharathifertility@gmail.com', 'Sir , \r\n Kindly guide me as Iâ€™m not able to make payment due to some symbols in my clinic name .Kindly let me edit it once again. I would be really grateful if u help me with this at the earliest .\r\n                                         Dr  RENUKA DEVI \r\n                                         9840053329', '2022-10-14', 1, '2022-10-18 04:23:22'),
(53, 'centerheadmys@kangaroocareindia.com', 'Dear  NARTSR Support Team,\r\nDue to oversight we had entered the Promotion/DIsplay name instead of the REGISTERED name in the Application form for ART clinic.\r\n \r\nRequesting to change the name of the clinic.\r\n\r\nREGISTERED NAME: SURABHI MYSORE HEALTHCARE & RESEARCH PRIVATE LIMITED.\r\n\r\nRevert for the requirement of any supporting documents. Speedy action and acknowledgement on the same will be highly appreciated.\r\nLogin Credentials:\r\nemail id same as above\r\nPassword: 654321\r\n\r\nKindly do the needful.\r\nThank you.', '2022-10-20', 0, '2022-10-21 04:48:40'),
(54, 'avhrc@rediffmail.com', 'Dear Sir/Madam\r\nI want to update my address 32, Chitra Vihar, Vikas Marg, Delhi-110092.\r\nplease i request you update my address.', '2022-11-10', 0, '2022-11-15 03:50:04'),
(55, 'jbansalmamc@gmail.com', 'Dear sir mam, i want to correct the address of art clinic entred on the website but there is no option.\r\nplease help ', '2022-11-16', 1, '2022-11-18 08:29:49'),
(56, 'lakhanivishakha07@gmail.com', 'Kindly guide me through the steps to change the name of our ART clinic from Jay Hospital and women care centre to â€˜Jay Hospital.â€™\r\nWaiting in anticipation.\r\nThanks and regards\r\nDr Vishakha Lakhani ', '2022-11-16', 1, '2022-11-18 08:30:40'),
(57, 'anhirc2003@gmail.com', 'Subject: ERROR IN NAME OF FACILITY IN ART CLINIC REGISTRATION\r\n\r\nRespected Sir/Madam,\r\nThis is Dr Jyoti Bobe from Airoli, Navi Mumbai. It has come to our notice that there is a mistake in the name of the facility in the ART CLINIC form and we are unable to edit it or make another prolife with the right name.\r\nName of the Facility: Dr Jyoti A Bobe\'s Anuja Nursing Home and Infertility Research Centre (This is how it appears in all the relevant government registrations)\r\nName on the ART Form: Dr Jyoti Bobe\'s Anuja Nursing Home and Infertility Research CentreR (There is an additional R at the end of Centre).\r\nKindly note the following and guide us regarding the same.\r\nThanking you in anticipation\r\nDr Jyoti Bobe\r\n9821158925', '2022-11-22', 1, '2022-11-25 10:54:36'),
(58, 'bhoomreddyknr@gmail.com', 'Subject: Request to Change of name Dr Bhoom Reddy fertility centre, Karimnagar Telangana.\r\n\r\nRespected sir/mam\r\nPFA and do the needful\r\n\r\nThank you.\r\n\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nDr.Bhoom Reddy\'s Hospital\r\nKarimnagar\r\nTelangana\r\n9440517375', '2022-12-01', 1, '2022-12-02 04:00:09'),
(59, 'drarun13@gmail.com', 'R/S \r\nAs per document attached herewith , we have applied for ART LEVEL 1 CLINIC ( Application no MH/AC/2022/13666 ...Our clinic name has been changed to \"Dr Deshmukh\'s HEALTH PLUS CLINIC \"  after we created profile on artsurrogacy registry site in the name of \"health plus clinic \". \r\nPlease make the necessary changes in the name and do needful...Please revert \r\n', '2022-12-06', 1, '2022-12-07 04:15:56'),
(60, 'matritava@gmail.com', 'Dear Sir/Madam\r\nKindly make a correction in the Name and address filled in the art clinic and surrogacy application form as given below.\r\nName Of the Center : Matritava Advanced IVF & Training Centre\r\nAddress : 29 B, Paschimi Marg, Vasant Vihar, New Delhi, Pin Code 110047\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\n--\r\nMatritava Advanced IVF & Training Centre\r\n29, paschimi marg, vasant vihar, New Delhi- 110070', '2022-12-15', 1, '2022-12-15 11:40:06'),
(61, 'nidhimishra3611@gmail.com', 'SIR/Madam,\r\nThis is to bring to your notice that the name of our centre in the national registry application was not uploaded in full, and instead of Vardaan fertility centre, it has been loaded ART clinic only. I am running this clinic since five years with the same name., registered with the PCPNDT, Indore. Kindly, update the name from ART CLINIC to VARDAAN FERTILITY CENTRE. Rest of the things remain same. Thanks & Regards', '2022-12-22', 1, '2022-12-22 10:16:01'),
(62, 'seema.phogat@zeevafertility.com', 'Dear Sir/ Madam\r\n\r\nThis is to bring to your kind notice that we have registered ourselves\r\nas ART Clinic, ART Bank, and Surrogacy Clinic.\r\nIn all three the STD code was typed wrongly in the Contact Number of the\r\nOrganization. Need this to get corrected.\r\nPresently- 01244545479\r\nCorrected one- 01204545479\r\n\r\nAttaching all three application forms for your reference.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\nSeema\r\nZeeva HealthPlus\r\n9315918149', '2022-12-22', 1, '2022-12-22 10:16:36'),
(63, 'nidhimishra3611@gmail.com', 'SIR/Madam,\r\nThis is to bring to your notice that the name of our centre in the national registry application was not uploaded in full, and instead of Vardaan fertility centre, it has been loaded ART clinic only. I am running this clinic since five years with the same name., registered with the PCPNDT, Indore. Kindly, update the name from ART CLINIC to VARDAAN FERTILITY CENTRE. Rest of the things remain same.\r\n\r\nDr Nidhi Mishra', '2022-12-22', 1, '2022-12-22 10:17:18'),
(64, 'totalfertilitysolutions@gmail.com', 'Respected Sir/ Madam ,\r\nWe wish to shift our centre which is at temporary rented space , Total Fertility Solutions ,1st & 2nd Floor Sakar Bhawan , 21/4 Ratlam Kothi Indore 452001 to (new location which is just 100 m away ) to our permanent owned address Total Fertility Solutions First floor 101,Eesh Kripa Building,16/1/1, South Tukoganj ,Street Number 3 , Indore  452001.\r\n\r\nKindly grant me permission for the same and guide us on the process of Address change on the Online portal .\r\n\r\nRegards\r\nDr Shivani Joshi\r\nDiploma Reproductive Medicine ( Germany ) \r\nMS (Obgy) , MBBS\r\nConsultant IVF & Endoscopy \r\nTotal Fertility Solutions Indore.\r\n9167154735', '2022-12-28', 1, '2022-12-28 08:47:39'),
(65, 'atimrana07@gmail.com', 'test', '2023-01-02', 1, '2023-01-02 06:06:28'),
(66, 'seema.phogat@zeevafertility.com', 'Dear Sir/ Madam\r\n\r\nThis is to bring to your kind notice that we have registered ourselves\r\nas ART Clinic.\r\nIn all three the STD code was typed wrongly in the Contact Number of the\r\nOrganization. Need this to get corrected.\r\nPresently- 01244545479\r\nCorrected one- 01204545479\r\n\r\nAttaching all three application forms for your reference.\r\n\r\n\r\nThanks & Regards\r\nSeema\r\nZeeva HealthPlus\r\n9315918149', '2023-02-13', 0, '2023-02-13 11:13:50'),
(67, 'narmadahadigal@yahoo.com', 'Respected sir,\r\nI dr Narmada devi Hadigal,running my fertility center by name NARMDA FERTILITY AND WOMENS CLINIC SINCE 12 yrs at Secunderabad but the center name came as only ART CENTER in national registry.\r\nYesterday the inspection is over at my center and the authority asked me to correct it  as the name is only ART CENTER.\r\nKindly consider it and change the name as it is written in all other registration s like PNDT and ALLOPATHY HOSPITAL REGISTRATION S like NARMADA FERTILITY And WOMEN S CLINIC.\r\nThanking you ,\r\nYours sincerely,\r\nDr Narmada devi .H,\r\nSecunderabad ,\r\nCell no-9848114279.', '2023-03-17', 0, '2023-03-20 04:31:20'),
(68, 'info@miraifertility.in', 'Respected Sir/Ma\'am,\r\nWe want to change the Name of the ART clinic as it is filled by company name. Inspection of the centre is not done yet. \r\n\r\nApplication no-JH/AC/2023/14450\r\nApplication form for level-2 Clinic\r\n(Peviously filled)Name of the Art clinic-GITA ISVARA HEALTHCARE PVT. LTD.\r\n(Changes to be made) Name of the ART clinic-MIRAI FERTILITY & IVF CENTRE \r\n\r\nRequest you to kindly look into the matter and do the needful help from your end.', '2023-08-28', 1, '2023-08-28 06:04:52');
